{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "皆さんこんにちは株式会社さくらさくら", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901834.9796903}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "+代表の中山です。本日は2026年7月期", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901839.4086492}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "第3四半期決算についてご案内申し上げます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901842.1486707}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は二千二十六年七月期、第三四半期", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901847.1883752}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "決算概要についてお知らせいたします。売上高に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901850.9047892}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ついては百三十六億七千九百万となり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901854.65386}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "前年同期比五点四パーセントの減収となりました。これは", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901858.0576348}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "既存園の在籍率向上や工程価格の上昇による", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901862.9266672}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "補助金増額、保育所の新規開設や増床が寄与し", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901867.3483834}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "主力の保育サービスにおいて増収となりました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901871.0934854}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "一方不動産事業は前期に計上した", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901876.099721}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "大型不動産売却案件の反動により", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901879.9701319}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "当期も不動産売却は実施したものの", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901883.050558}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "全体としては減少となりました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901883.6112757}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "なおその他サービスは概ね計画どおり進捗しております", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901888.330729}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "営業利益は十億六千百万円となり、前年同期比", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901893.3906972}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "一点五パーセントの原因となりました。しかし", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901897.4409168}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不採算事業の絶対や中核事業の合理化", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901901.0206497}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "業務効率化により営業利益率は", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901904.2201052}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "五パーセントから七点八パーセントに向上しました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901907.291695}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "経常利益は十一億二千八百万円と", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901910.4408333}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、前年同期9。5の増益となりました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901913.7995417}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2-20260713-091703-23fb3a9d", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "保育所の新規改正", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783901917.990667}
